{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53184","headline":"诗偈 九 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世上蠢蠢者，相见只论钱，张三五百贯，李四有几千，赵大折却本，五六太迍邅。\n口常谈三业，心中慾火然。\n痴狼咬肚热，贪鬼撮头牵。\n有脚复有足，开眼常睡眠。\n罗刹同心腹，何日见青天。\n青天不可见，地狱结因缘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53184.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53184","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}